sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Courier
    participant App as Browser app
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Order as Order Service

    C->>App: /browse
    Note over App: location sent only when granted and on campus, otherwise ranked by reward
    App->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders?latitude&longitude&size=100
    GW->>Order: authorize, forward
    Order-->>App: open requests, nearest pickup first
    C->>App: Accept
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/accept
    alt someone else accepted first
        Order-->>App: 409
        App-->>C: "already accepted", list refreshed
    else accepted
        Order-->>App: Accepted
        App-->>C: /deliveries/{id}
    end
    loop every 5 seconds while visible
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/{id}
    end
    C->>App: photo at pickup
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/collect, multipart photo
    Order-->>App: Collected
    C->>App: photo at dropoff
    App->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/deliver, multipart photo
    Order-->>App: Delivered
    Note over App: re-checks pending ratings after 1.5, 4 and 10 seconds
